      en: ["Dedicated to soldiers from Ivory Coast who fought for France.", "Commemorates victims of the First (1914–1918) and Second World Wars (1939–1945).", "Located in the historic Treichville district of Abidjan.", "Central site for military and state commemorative ceremonies.", "Situated near the Treichville Town Hall.", "Symbolizes the role of the 'Tirailleurs sénégalais' and Ivorian troops."],
